Description:
// 760 ENGINE HOURS //

// AIR-CONDITIONING //

// GTN 650i TOUCHSCREENS //

// BLUETOOTH AUDIO //

Mason Amelia proudly presents N181WT, a quick, clean, AIR-CONDITIONED G1 SR22 with only 750 HOURS on the FACTORY-REMAN dialed-in engine. 

With Garmin 650xi touchscreen NAV/COMs, semi-portable oxygen, TKS ice protection, plus the peace of mind of CAPS, this SR22 is the ideal entry point into the Cirrus life. Add the PMA450B Bluetooth Audio Panel, Stormscope, Active Traffic, EMAX Engine Monitoring, CMAX Approach Plates, and Terrain Awareness, and you have a very capable aircraft ready for years of service.

Loved like a family member, and flown with precision and care by an owner in the know, 1WT offers four-season comfort and everyday utility at less than half the cost of a G5 with similar engine hours. Also: lighter, faster, simpler.

Call Tom Donaldson to learn more about this great Cirrus.

FOR WALKAROUND VIDEO AND ADDITIONAL MEDIA, VISIT  OR OUR YOUTUBE CHANNEL, “LOOKING FOR HIGHER.”

